  "data_policy": "Wholly synthetic reference definitions. No measured results.",
  "notes": [
    "Status 'draft': these definitions are reference data for review. Non-safety thresholds are deliberately uncalibrated.",
    "Held-out obligations are counts only; this file names no held-out case, label or held-out-owned record.",
    "accepted_bases exclude every T1/T2 basis: schema checks and mock-level observations can never pass a promotion gate.",
    "Comparison flags are draft v1 defaults (owner-reviewable): eligibility correctness and unknown-state preservation must be observed for both runs; verifier recall/false alarms are required when the strategy contains a verifier; latency and cost are reported only; citation precision, reviewer usefulness and zero-tolerance counts are not compared (the safety gate enforces violations).",
    "F3 (RAP-F3-PLAN-2026-11-04 rev. 1.1, decision F3-D2 option P1): metric definitions v1 and reviewer rubric v1 are byte-equal copies of definitions v1. Only the draft safety-gate policy changes: version 3 pins golden manifest evalset_golden v2; every category, accepted basis, mandatory golden case and the held-out manifest pin is identical to policy v1.",
    "Policy versions are not a linear supersession: policy v2 (definitions v2 file) pins metrics v2 and golden v1; policy v3 pins metrics v1 and golden v2. Nothing here is approved; every status remains draft."
  ],
